<div class="grid facts">
  <section class="glass span-8 reveal" aria-labelledby="needs">
    <p class="eyebrow">Before you start</p>
    <h2 id="needs">What it needs</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>A Mac, Apple Silicon or Intel. One download carries both.</li>
      <li>A model to talk to: an <a class="link" href="https://ollama.com/settings/keys" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Ollama Cloud key</a>, or an endpoint you point Atlantis at yourself.</li>
      <li>Room on the disk for the roster, its conversations and the logbook. The Storage tab in Tron says how much is used.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="glass span-7 reveal" aria-labelledby="install">
    <p class="eyebrow">Install</p>
    <h2 id="install">Three steps</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open the DMG and drag Atlantis onto Applications.</li>
      <li>Open it from Applications. If macOS says it cannot check the developer, open System Settings, then Privacy and Security, and press Open Anyway.</li>
      <li>Add a provider in Tron and make your first agent.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</div>
